OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader backs defence
OL,4,Aenterprise zone idea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA think tank's proposals to boost local
OL,7,Fmanufacturing jobs has been backed by a
OL,8,Fcouncil leader.
OL,10,FThe neoliberal think tank Adam Smith
OL,11,FInstitute (ASI) said the zones in areas
OL,12,Fsuch as High Haining on the outskirts
OL,13,Fof Sunderland and Blaydon Quarry could
OL,14,Flead to more local investment and jobs.
OL,16,FThe zones would allow industries such
OL,17,Fas the defence sector to take advantage
OL,18,Fof "streamlined planning" and "targeted
OL,19,Ftax incentives", the organisation said.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
